    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"let it all go\"? like is there actually a way to just stop the hurting? i feel like if i could just disappear, everyone would finally be able to breathe again. i'd be doing them a favor. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do.",
